      "id": "step-5",
      "number": 5,
      "heading": "Warm the ciabatta",
      "blocks": [
        "Halve and warm the ciabattas in the oven for 2–3 minutes. Thinly slice the pork. Toss tomatoes and three quarters of the rocket with the lemon dressing."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
